    {
      "text": "A page render with footnote text and Figure 4, a forest plot of TBST sensitivity (%) in children: DST AI (three studies) pooled at 94.74% (70.61–99.26) and DST 5mm (Starshinova 2018) at 100.00%. The overall random-effects pooled sensitivity is 97.06% (81.86–99.59) across 34 participants.",
      "lang": "en",
      "state": "draft",
